OL,3,GDumfries, Galloway, Lothian & Borders
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FLargely
OL,6,Fcloudy in the east at first with the
OL,7,Fodd spot of rain. Otherwise dry with
OL,8,Fincreasing clear spells developing,
OL,9,Fallowing areas of fog to form. Patchy
OL,10,Frural frost.
OL,11,
OL,12,CMonday:FA chilly start with fog in
OL,13,Fplaces. Otherwise mostly dry with
OL,14,Fvariable cloud and bright or sunny
OL,15,Fspells. Some showers around the east
OL,16,Fcoast. Frost and fog possible again
OL,17,Fovernight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
