OL,5,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FDry
OL,6,FTuesday with variable cloud and sunny
OL,7,Fspells. Bright spells and perhaps
OL,8,Fshowers on Wednesday. Colder but dry
OL,9,Fand sunnier on Thursday. Overnight
OL,10,Ffrost and fog possible under clearer
OL,11,Fskies.
